<<socialiseicon>><<link [[停下脚步与维斯深谈 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -4>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[点头致意后继续赶路 (0:02)|($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")]]>><<pass 2>><<stress -2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>><<lstress>>

:: MP NPC Noel Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">>
<<effects>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
